{"type":"after","callId":"jgqi@2523","endTime":329297.684,"result":{"value":"All projects\nWEB EXPERIENCE / 13\nKegelklock.\n\nA program website introducing KegelKlock’s exercise offering through information, courses, and membership navigation.\n\nPROJECT TYPE\nWeb & web apps\nFOCUS\nExercise & wellbeing\nORIGINAL PROJECT ARTWORK\nOverview\nKey features\nDesign\nScreenshots\nDevice views\n01\nPROJECT OVERVIEW\nA focused home for an exercise program.\n\nKegelKlock’s website artwork introduces an incontinence exercise program and pelvic-floor exercise content. The interface includes navigation for information, courses, settings, and subscription areas. This presentation describes the visible program and interface without making medical-effectiveness claims.\n\n02\nKEY FEATURES\nA closer look at\nthe experience.\n\nThe flows and interface elements visible in Kegelklock's original project material.\n\n01\nProgram introduction\n\nThe landing page introduces the exercise program and its subject.\n\n02\nCourse navigation\n\nA dedicated route appears for course-related content.\n\n03\nMembership areas\n\nSubscription and account-oriented navigation are visible in the designs.\n\n04\nProgram information\n\nSupporting sections provide space for explaining the offering.\n\n03\nDESIGN DIRECTION\nIts own identity.\nIn every detail.\nExercise & wellbeing\n\nYellow is the dominant brand color, paired with white content and lifestyle photography. The website uses a direct introductory headline followed by explanatory sections, keeping program information visually connected to the brand.\n\nDesign observations from the supplied project artwork.\n04\nUI SCREENSHOTS & ARTWORK\nInside Kegelklock.\n\nExplore the original interface screens. Select any image for a closer look.\n\nDESIGN COMPOSITION\n01\nDESIGN COMPOSITION\n02\nDESIGN COMPOSITION\n03\nDESIGN COMPOSITION\n04\nDESIGN COMPOSITION\n05\n05\nRESPONSIVE DESIGN PRESENTATION\nA view across\nthe original devices.\n\nKegelklock's original portfolio composition presents the website on laptop and tablet devices. The artwork below preserves those supplied layouts together, with their original proportions.\n\nThese are source mockups of the project, rather than a new rendering of its live website.\n\nKegelklock / Original device composition\nSOURCE MATERIAL\n\nProject descriptions are based on the published artwork and available overview. Interface observations do not imply verified implementation details or measured business results.\n\nOriginal project page\nNEXT WEB PROJECT\nBR-tennis\nKEEP EXPLORING\nMore perspectives.\nView all work\nSPORTS & COACHING\nBR-tennis\nMORTGAGE & FINANCE\nNetwork Capital\nCOURSES & LEARNING\nWhizara\nHAVE A PROJECT IN MIND?\nLet's make your\nnext idea real.\nBook a free consultation"}}
